\NeedsTeXFormat{LaTeX2e}
\ProvidesPackage{semio-viz-domain}[2026/09/06 v0.3.0 semio viz long-tail domain families (schedule, optimization, performance, monitoring, version-control, logistics, survey, election, niche, neural, biology, engineering-diagram, spatial-layout)]

